   "stem": "<p><i>P</i>, <i>Q</i> and <i>R</i> are three lighthouses.<br>The bearing of <i>Q</i> from <i>P</i> is 118\u00b0 and the bearing of <i>R</i> from <i>Q</i> is 226\u00b0.<br><i>PQ</i> = <i>QR</i> = 12 km.</p>",
